
>> ⚄ := Into okusha.

⚄ uma-kufika: ['uhlobo'] yenza: { <- ['Object'].
}.

Okuphumayo bhala: ['⇿?↵'] ? ⚄ uhlobo.
Okuphumayo bhala: ['⇿?↵'] ? Isikhathi uhlobo.
Okuphumayo bhala: ['⇿?↵'] ? Uhlelo uhlobo.
Okuphumayo bhala: ['⇿?↵'] ? (1 ≠ 2).
Okuphumayo bhala: ['⇿?↵'] ? (2 ≥ 1).
Okuphumayo bhala: ['⇿?↵'] ? (1 ≤ 2).
